      "slug": "games",
      "title": "Every version",
      "nav_label": "Versions",
      "summary": "Six versions of Rogue were rebuilt from their original binaries in 2026, and PC Rogue and XRogue are coming soon. The rest are restorations from their authors' source, made between 1992 and 2006, and still waiting for the same treatment.",
      "families": [
        {
          "label": "Rogue at Berkeley",
          "blurb": "Michael Toy, Glenn Wichman and Ken Arnold's game, as found with BSD Unix for the PDP-11 and the VAX.",
