      "intro_md": "As the Archmage Yendor, I am far too busy to write an extensive guide, or indeed to write anything at all. Still, to spare myself the pleas for help from the many fools who would brave the Dungeons of Doom, I have gathered here what little information has been made available to the general populace. I confess the inaccuracies make me chuckle, but watching you suffer through them will afford me some small entertainment, and I shall observe your feeble attempts with amusement, as time permits. Should you escape with anything of interest, do stop by; I may spare you a few minutes.\n\n*The Archmage Yendor*"
    },
    {
      "slug": "history",
      "title": "History",
      "nav_label": "History",
      "summary": "Forty-five years of Rogue, from a game written at Santa Cruz in 1980 to the rebuilds of 2026, and how the versions are related.",
      "order": [
        "history"
      ],
      "single": true
    }
  ],
