    "caption": "<p class=\"for-wide\">Each room is a version, joined by a corridor to the one it grew from; the pale corridor marks work that PC Rogue and Rogue 5.3 shared. Rog-O-Matic stands alone: it plays Rogue rather than descending from it. <span class=\"legend\"><span class=\"status status--rebuilt\">Lit rooms</span></span> have been published in their Redux form, <span class=\"legend\"><span class=\"status status--soon\">lavender rooms</span></span> are coming soon, and <span class=\"legend\"><span class=\"status status--port\">dark rooms</span></span> are still to come. Choose a room to read about it.</p><p class=\"for-narrow\">The versions of Rogue published in their Redux form, each joined to the one it grew from. Choose a room to read about it, or see every version below.</p>",
